00:25:29,680 --> 00:25:33,840
Now then, the Kameari Kōen-mae police
box's annual trip is about to begin.

424
00:25:34,260 --> 00:25:36,140
This time's theme is Tokyo.

425
00:25:36,140 --> 00:25:38,200
First, we'll tour Tokyo's traditions.

426
00:25:38,200 --> 00:25:39,400
A river cruise.

427
